title: Delegation to Moscow
subtitle: The Executive Committee of the International hears the German factions in person.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: rf_moscow
view-if: rf_delegation_timer <= 0 and funds >= 1
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rf_delegation_timer = 3

= Delegation to Moscow

You can send your best speakers to the ECCI in Moscow. The International settles German disputes there, often before the German party has discussed them.

- @argue: Argue your faction's line.
- @listen: Listen, and promise to carry out the ECCI's decisions.

@argue
on-arrival: {!
Q.funds -= 1;
Q[Q.player + '_moscow'] += 6;
Q.autonomy -= 1;
!}

Your delegates argue well. Some of the Russian leaders are impressed; others take note of your independence.

@listen
on-arrival: {!
Q.funds -= 1;
Q[Q.player + '_moscow'] += 10;
Q.autonomy -= 4;
Q[Q.player + '_dissent'] -= 4;
!}

Your delegates promise discipline. Moscow likes obedient Germans. The precedent will outlive you.
